 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "CustomerRevenueSystem(): insert(revenue) and insertWithReferrer(revenue, referrerId) create customers with sequential ids from 0 and return the id. A customer's total = own revenue + own revenue of customers they directly referred. getLowestK(k, minTotal) returns up to k ids with total >= minTotal, ordered by total ascending then id ascending.",
